  "tarball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/espressif/arduino-esp32/tarball/3.3.12",
  "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/espressif/arduino-esp32/zipball/3.3.12",
  "body": "## What's Changed\r\n* fix(webserver): Harden security and fix hangs by @lucasssvaz in https://github.com/espressif/arduino-esp32/pull/12794\r\n* ci(upload): Optimize scripts and upload test by @lucasssvaz in https://github.com/espressif/arduino-esp32/pull/12773\r\n* build(deps): bump cryptography from 48.0.1 to 50.0.0 in /tests by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/espressif/arduino-esp32/pull/12804\r\n* docs(compatibility): Add notes on ESP8266 compatibility by @lucasssvaz in https://github.com/espressif/arduino-esp32/pull/12802\r\n* docs(adc): Correct attenuation enum names to match the Arduino API by @Rubi9981 in https://github.com/espressif/arduino-esp32/pull/12777\r\n* fix(cmake): Add HTTPUpdateServer to Arduino library list by @ThomasMaier73 in https://github.com/espressif/arduino-esp32/pull/12786\r\n* feat(boards): Add MInimal partitions for MakerGo C3 Supermini by @P-R-O-C-H-Y in https://github.com/espressif/arduino-esp32/pull/12791\r\n* docs(ledc): Add info about timer sharing and frequency limits by @P-R-O-C-H-Y in https://github.com/espressif/arduino-esp32/pull/12793\r\n* fix(ble): Fix oversized AD bounds by @lucasssvaz in https://github.com/espressif/arduino-esp32/pull/12805\r\n* feat(board): add Waveshare ESP32-C5-Zero by @H-sw123 in https://github.com/espressif/arduino-esp32/pull/12807\r\n* feat(board): add Waveshare ESP32-S3-Touch-LCD-4.3C by @H-sw123 in https://github.com/espressif/arduino-esp32/pull/12808\r\n* feat(doc):  include Home Assistant as Matter environment by @SuGlider in https://github.com/espressif/arduino-esp32/pull/12810\r\n* feat(uart): improve example documentation by @SuGlider in https://github.com/espressif/arduino-esp32/pull/12745\r\n* fix(acmake): Fix cache invalidation when libs change by @lucasssvaz in https://github.com/espressif/arduino-esp32/pull/12806\r\n* fix(zigbee): Check proper return of readAttribute and configure by @P-R-O-C-H-Y in https://github.com/espressif/arduino-esp32/pull/12799\r\n* feat(ota): Add support for IPv6 OTA by @lucasssvaz in https://github.com/espressif/arduino-esp32/pull/12803\r\n* feat(board): add Waveshare ESP32-C5-LCD-1.47 by @H-sw123 in https://github.com/espressif/arduino-esp32/pull/12811\r\n* fix(littlefs): zero-init conf to avoid -Werror by @richardsonnick in https://github.com/espressif/arduino-esp32/pull/12836\r\n* feat(esp32): added useBuiltinCACertBundle to NetworkClientSecure by @remi-ngton in https://github.com/espressif/arduino-esp32/pull/12792\r\n* fix(cpu): Fix memory leak in getSupportedCpuFrequencyMhz by @richardsonnick in https://github.com/espressif/arduino-esp32/pull/12838\r\n* fix(matter): fix binary sensors for Matter 1.5 by @SuGlider in https://github.com/espressif/arduino-esp32/pull/12842\r\n* feat(update): add optional SHA-256 checksum for incoming firmware by @EyJunge1 in https://github.com/espressif/arduino-esp32/pull/12824\r\n* feat(board): Add Waveshare ESP32-S3-Touch-LCD-7C-BOX board by @H-sw123 in https://github.com/espressif/arduino-esp32/pull/12812\r\n* feat(board): Add Waveshare ESP32-S3 RGB Matrix by @H-sw123 in https://github.com/espressif/arduino-esp32/pull/12813\r\n* feat(boards): Add Raiden S01 ESP32-S3 devkit board by @RaidenTechnology in https://github.com/espressif/arduino-esp32/pull/12835\r\n* feat(openthread): add SRP / DNS-SD API by @SuGlider in https://github.com/espressif/arduino-esp32/pull/12818\r\n* feat(ble): Add test cases and memory management documentation by @lucasssvaz in https://github.com/espressif/arduino-esp32/pull/12825\r\n* fix(matter): fix light color control within Matter 1.5 by @SuGlider in https://github.com/espressif/arduino-esp32/pull/12846\r\n* feat(matter): allow setting Matter Descriptor TagList attribute for endpoint by @lboue in https://github.com/espressif/arduino-esp32/pull/12776\r\n* feat(httpupdate): add optional checksum sidecar URLs by @EyJunge1 in https://github.com/espressif/arduino-esp32/pull/12848\r\n* feat(ethernet): Make W5500 polling period configurable by @sblantipodi in https://github.com/espressif/arduino-esp32/pull/12856\r\n* feat(matter): node identity, live pairing codes, and CASE based isOnline() by @SuGlider in https://github.com/espressif/arduino-esp32/pull/12857\r\n* feat(boards): Add Edge Dalton (ESP32-C3) board by @ConsentiumIoT in https://github.com/espressif/arduino-esp32/pull/12844\r\n* feat(wifi): add setInactiveTime/getInactiveTime for STA by @EyJunge1 in https://github.com/espressif/arduino-esp32/pull/12867\r\n* fix(clock): Fix supported CPU frequencies and SPI clock when using XTAL by @lucasssvaz in https://github.com/espressif/arduino-esp32/pull/12859\r\n* ci(upload): Fix upload test gating by @lucasssvaz in https://github.com/espressif/arduino-esp32/pull/12874\r\n* fix(hosted): Pin version for lower hosted RAM usage by @me-no-dev in https://github.com/espressif/arduino-esp32/pull/12879\r\n* ci(p4): Align FQBN with upcoming EV board USB defaults by @lucasssvaz in https://github.com/espressif/arduino-esp32/pull/12875\r\n* fix(ble): Report failed pairings instead of silently succeeding by @lucasssvaz in https://github.com/espressif/arduino-esp32/pull/12878\r\n* fix(wifiprov): Make sure BLE is allocated when using WiFiProv by @lucasssvaz in https://github.com/espressif/arduino-esp32/pull/12885\r\n* fix(httpclient): Fix socket reuse for HTTP 1 and test chain by @lucasssvaz in https://github.com/espressif/arduino-esp32/pull/12886\r\n* fix(cpu): Fix clock calculation for H2 and C6 by @lucasssvaz in https://github.com/espressif/arduino-esp32/pull/12887\r\n* WebServer: read request body for HTTP QUERY (RFC 10008) by @EyJunge1 in https://github.com/espressif/arduino-esp32/pull/12895\r\n* fix(HTTPUpdate): Fix max image size for updates by @lucasssvaz in https://github.com/espressif/arduino-esp32/pull/12883\r\n* feat(update): add optional SHA512 checksum and sidecar URLs by @EyJunge1 in https://github.com/espressif/arduino-esp32/pull/12865\r\n* fix(ci): Set P4 usbmode for sd2usbmsc example by @P-R-O-C-H-Y in https://github.com/espressif/arduino-esp32/pull/12903\r\n* feat(matter): network selection, BLE memory control, and commissioning by @SuGlider in https://github.com/espressif/arduino-esp32/pull/12871\r\n* feat(usb): Add USB Host library (HID,MSC,Serial) by @P-R-O-C-H-Y in https://github.com/espressif/arduino-esp32/pull/12837\r\n* IDF v5.5.5 by @me-no-dev in https://github.com/espressif/arduino-esp32/pull/12905\r\n* Add new board variant: Cytron Maker ESP32 by @zakiegud in https://github.com/espressif/arduino-esp32/pull/12873\r\n* fix(periman): correct ETHERNET_MCD typo to ETHERNET_MDC (Management Data Clock) by @pruthvi828 in https://github.com/espressif/arduino-esp32/pull/12908\r\n\r\n## New Contributors\r\n* @Rubi9981 made their first contribution in https://github.com/espressif/arduino-esp32/pull/12777\r\n* @ThomasMaier73 made their first contribution in https://github.com/espressif/arduino-esp32/pull/12786\r\n* @richardsonnick made their first contribution in https://github.com/espressif/arduino-esp32/pull/12836\r\n* @remi-ngton made their first contribution in https://github.com/espressif/arduino-esp32/pull/12792\r\n* @EyJunge1 made their first contribution in https://github.com/espressif/arduino-esp32/pull/12824\r\n* @RaidenTechnology made their first contribution in https://github.com/espressif/arduino-esp32/pull/12835\r\n* @ConsentiumIoT made their first contribution in https://github.com/espressif/arduino-esp32/pull/12844\r\n* @zakiegud made their first contribution in https://github.com/espressif/arduino-esp32/pull/12873\r\n* @pruthvi828 made their first contribution in https://github.com/espressif/arduino-esp32/pull/12908\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/espressif/arduino-esp32/compare/3.3.11...3.3.12",
